WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:01.653
Give a lift a tempo.

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:06.930
Give a lift in your own program a tempo. Type it in, and you are done.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:13.265
The set card spells it out. Three seconds down, one still, then up fast.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.576
Barforge Weightlifting is free to download. Pro unlocks this.
